<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's fiscal surplus 6.6 bln pesos by mid-April.</title>
<headline>Manila's fiscal surplus 6.6 bln pesos by mid-April.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a 6.6 billion peso budget surplus as of the third week of April, Finance Secretary Roberto de Ocampo said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The government is targetting a 12.135 billion peso surplus by the end of the year.</p>
<p>By the end of March, the government had posted a 648 million peso deficit. The turnaround was due to the collection of individual income taxes in April.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
